ke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Secured Access</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5 relative group hover:border-brand-cyan/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan shadow-[0_0_10px_#00F0FF]\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail text-brand-cyan mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1\">0</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Emails Today</div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5 relative group hover:border-brand-cyan/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan shadow-[0_0_10px_#00F0FF]\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap text-brand-cyan mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1\">0</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Mails Generated</div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5 relative group hover:border-brand-cyan/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan shadow-[0_0_10px_#00F0FF]\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe text-brand-cyan mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1\">0</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Active Inboxes</div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5 relative group hover:border-brand-cyan/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan shadow-[0_0_10px_#00F0FF]\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock text-brand-cyan mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1\">2</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Domains</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-dark-900 relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><span class=\"text-brand-cyan text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-2 block\">Features</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white\">Everything You Need for an<!-- --> <span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-purple\">Instant EDU Mail</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Get an instant .edu email in seconds, unlock student benefits, and manage your inbox with ease. We also keep your privacy protected.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Instant .edu Email</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">No registration required. Create a student-style email in seconds and unlock benefits.</p></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Student Benefits</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Use your .edu address to claim GitHub, Spotify, Adobe, and other student offers.</p></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-history\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v5l4 2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Email History</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Access your previous .edu emails and received messages anytime.</p></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bell\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Sound Notifications - Beta</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Get instant audio alerts when new messages arrive in your inbox.</p></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Save Favorites - Beta</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Star important emails to save them for later reference.</p></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">QR Code Access</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Scan QR codes to quickly access your .edu inbox on any device.</p></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Privacy Protected</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Optional login to sync across devices. We never sell your data.</p></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Instant Generation</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Get your instant .edu email in milliseconds — no forms, no waiting.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"py-20 bg-dark-900 border-t border-white/5\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><span class=\"text-brand-cyan text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-2 block\">How It Works</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white\">Simple as<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-gradient-text bg-clip-text text-transparent\">1-2-3-4</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 relative\"><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute top-12 left-[10%] right-[10%] h-[2px] bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-brand-purple/30 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center z-10\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-dark-800 border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -top-3 bg-dark-900 border border-brand-cyan/30 text-brand-cyan text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">01</div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mouse-pointer2 lucide-mouse-pointer-2 text-brand-cyan group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.037 4.688a.495.495 0 0 1 .651-.651l16 6.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.063.947l-6.124 1.58a2 2 0 0 0-1.438 1.435l-1.579 6.126a.5.5 0 0 1-.947.063z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl mb-3\">Create Instant .edu</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Click the button to instantly generate your instant .edu email address.</p></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center z-10\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-dark-800 border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -top-3 bg-dark-900 border border-brand-cyan/30 text-brand-cyan text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">02</div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy text-brand-cyan group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl mb-3\">Unlock Benefits</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Use your .edu email to claim student discounts on GitHub, Spotify, Adobe, and more.</p></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center z-10\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-dark-800 border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -top-3 bg-dark-900 border border-brand-cyan/30 text-brand-cyan text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">03</div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail text-brand-cyan group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl mb-3\">Receive Emails</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Verification emails and offers arrive in your inbox in real-time.</p></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center z-10\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-dark-800 border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -top-3 bg-dark-900 border border-brand-cyan/30 text-brand-cyan text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">04</div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trash2 lucide-trash-2 text-brand-cyan group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 11v6\"></path><path d=\"M14 11v6\"></path><path d=\"M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6\"></path><path d=\"M3 6h18\"></path><path d=\"M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl mb-3\">Stay in Control</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Emails auto-expire when you&#x27;re done, so your privacy stays protected.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"benefits\" class=\"py-20 bg-dark-900 border-t border-white/5\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><span class=\"text-brand-cyan text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-2 block\">Benefits</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white\">Unlock Student Programs with Your<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-gradient-text bg-clip-text text-transparent\">EDU Email</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Create your instant .edu email above, then use it to claim free or discounted plans from GitHub, Spotify, Adobe, and more.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-github\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4\"></path><path d=\"M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">GitHub Student</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Get the GitHub Student Developer Pack: free access to GitHub Pro, domains, credits, and 100+ dev tools. Verify with your .edu email.</p><a href=\"https://education.github.com/pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-template\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"9\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"7\" x=\"16\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Notion for Education</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Free Notion Plus for students. Build wikis, docs, and project boards. Verify with your school email to unlock unlimited blocks and guests.</p><a href=\"https://www.notion.so/students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22a1 1 0 0 1 0-20 10 9 0 0 1 10 9 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-2.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.4 2.8l.3.4a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.4 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Figma Education</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Free Figma Professional for students and educators. Design, prototype, and collaborate with unlimited files and FigJam.</p><a href=\"https://www.figma.com/education/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-image\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Canva for Education</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Free Canva Pro for K–12 and higher education. Create presentations, posters, and social graphics with premium templates and stock.</p><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/for-education/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-music\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18V5l12-2v13\"></path><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Spotify Student</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Discounted Spotify Premium with Hulu and Showtime. Verify your enrollment to get 50% off for up to four years.</p><a href=\"https://www.spotify.com/student/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">JetBrains for Students</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Free professional IDEs: IntelliJ, PyCharm, WebStorm, and more. Use your .edu email to get a full license while you study.</p><a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/student/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-monitor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"21\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"17\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Microsoft 365 Education</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Free Office 365 for students: Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Teams, and 1TB OneDrive. Sign up with your school email.</p><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/education/products/teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Adobe Creative Cloud</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Over 60% off Creative Cloud for students. Get Photoshop, Illustrator, Premiere Pro, and the full suite with your .edu address.</p><a href=\"https://www.adobe.com/creativecloud/plans.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Autodesk Education</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Free access to AutoCAD, Maya, Fusion 360, and more for students and educators. Create a verified education account.</p><a href=\"https://www.autodesk.com/education/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Namecheap Education</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Discounted domains and hosting for students. Verify with your .edu email to get exclusive education pricing on domains.</p><a href=\"https://www.namecheap.com/education/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Grammarly for Education</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Free Grammarly Premium for students and educators. Get advanced writing suggestions, plagiarism detection, and tone insights with your .edu email.</p><a href=\"https://www.grammarly.com/education\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-cyan/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-dark-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-brand-cyan group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.103 6.034h17.794\"></path><path d=\"M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Amazon Prime Student</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed grow mb-5\">Six months of Prime free, then 50% off. Get free delivery, Prime Video, Prime Music, and exclusive student deals. Verify with your school email.</p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/prime/student\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-cyan text-black px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit\">Claim offer<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 bg-dark-900\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><span class=\"text-brand-cyan text-sm font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-2 block\">FAQ</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white\">Frequently Asked<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-gradient-text bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Questions</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 mt-4\">Got questions? We&#x27;ve got answers. If you can&#x27;t find what you&#x27;re looking for, feel free to contact us.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4 mb-20\"><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-brand-cyan\">What is an instant .edu email and how does it work?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-40 p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">An instant .edu-style email lets you receive mail at an education-style address. GetEduMail creates a real inbox for you in seconds — no sign-up required. You can use this address on student program sign-up forms, receive verification links and confirmation codes, and keep your personal inbox completely separate from promotional emails. It works just like any standard email address for receiving messages.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">How long does my .edu email last?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">By default, guest emails last for 2 hours. This is perfect for one-time verifications. You can delete them anytime, or create a free account and claim your address to keep it forever. Registered users keep their .edu email permanently and can access their inbox from any device by logging in.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Is GetEduMail really free? Are there hidden charges?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes — 100% free. Creating and using your .edu email costs nothing. There are no hidden fees, no premium tiers required for basic use, and no credit card needed. We believe everyone deserves access to student benefits, regardless of their financial situation. We cover costs through non-intrusive advertising.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">What student discounts can I unlock with a .edu email?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Dozens of major platforms offer student pricing when you verify with a school-style email. Popular ones include: GitHub Student Developer Pack (free GitHub Pro + 100+ dev tools), Spotify Premium Student (~50% off + Hulu), Amazon Prime Student (6 months free, then 50% off), Adobe Creative Cloud (60%+ off), Microsoft 365 Education (free Office apps + 1TB OneDrive), JetBrains IDEs (free professional tools), Figma Education (free Professional plan), Notion for Students (free Plus plan), Canva for Education (free Pro), Autodesk Education (free AutoCAD, Maya, and more), Grammarly for Education, and Namecheap student domain pricing.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Can I receive attachments and HTML emails?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes. Your GetEduMail inbox supports receiving standard email attachments such as images, PDFs, and documents. HTML-formatted emails display correctly, so verification emails and offer confirmations look exactly as intended. Storage limits apply and vary depending on whether the address is temporary or permanent.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Does GetEduMail work for GitHub Student Developer Pack verification?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">GetEduMail provides a real inbox that receives live emails, including GitHub&#x27;s verification messages. When you apply for the GitHub Student Developer Pack, you enter your .edu email and GitHub sends a verification link or code to that address. You can then open your GetEduMail inbox, receive the email, and complete verification. Note: GitHub&#x27;s own approval policies may vary — they evaluate factors like institution recognition and enrollment status.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Is my privacy protected? Who can see my emails?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Your privacy is a priority. We do not sell your data or your email contents to third parties. Guest emails are automatically purged after they expire. If you create an account, your inbox is protected by your login credentials. We use encryption in transit for all email delivery. You can also delete any email address and all its contents at any time, permanently.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Can I send emails from my GetEduMail address?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">GetEduMail is primarily designed for receiving emails — for example, receiving student verification links, confirmation codes, and offer details. Registered users with a claimed email address have the option to compose and send replies. For most student benefit use-cases (verifying with GitHub, Spotify, Amazon, etc.), you only need to receive emails.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">What happens to my email after it expires?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">When a temporary guest email expires after 2 hours, the address and all emails in its inbox are automatically deleted from our servers. You won&#x27;t be able to receive new emails to that address after expiry. If you want to keep an address permanently, sign up for a free account and claim it before it expires.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Can I choose my own username and domain?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes! When creating your email, you can type a custom username (e.g. yourname, studentjohn, etc.) and select from the available domains in the dropdown. If your preferred username is already taken or unavailable, the system will let you know in real-time so you can choose another. The available domains include several education-style options.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Do I need to sign up or create an account to use GetEduMail?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">No sign-up is required for a temporary (guest) email. Just visit the homepage, pick a username and domain, and click Create — your inbox is live instantly. If you want to keep your .edu email permanently, access it from multiple devices, or use advanced features, you can optionally create a free account. Registration takes under a minute.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-medium hover:text-brand-cyan hover:cursor-pointer text-white\">Is GetEduMail available in all countries?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes — GetEduMail works worldwide. There are no geographic restrictions on creating or using your instant .edu email address. Whether you&#x27;re in the US, India, Europe, Southeast Asia, or anywhere else, you can create an address and use it for student program sign-ups. Keep in mind that individual student programs (like Amazon Prime Student) may have their own country-specific eligibility requirements.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-linear-to-br from-dark-800 to-dark-900 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-purple/10 rounded-full blur-[80px]\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Ready for Your Free<!-- --> <span class=\"text-brand-cyan\">.edu Email?</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto\">Create your instant .edu email in seconds and unlock student discounts and benefits — it&#x27;s completely free!</p><div class=\"flex justify-center gap-4\"><a href=\"/#inbox-section\" class=\"bg-brand-cyan text-black px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,240,255,0.4)] transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:cursor-pointer inline-block\">Create Instant .edu Email →</a><a href=\"/#benefits\" class=\"bg-dark-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold border border-white/10 hover:bg-dark-600 transition-colors hover:cursor-pointer inline-block\">View Student Benefits</a></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-dark-900 pt-16 pb-8 border-t border-white/5\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-y-12 md:gap-x-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-1\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\" href=\"/\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient